{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2021-07-27 08:30:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON WEALTH MANAGEMENT NAMES JEREMY GONSALVES AS NATIONAL DIRECTOR OF PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT', 'text': "BOSTON, JULY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BNY MELLON WEALTH MANAGEMENT HAS APPOINTED JEREMY GONSALVES AS NATIONAL DIRECTOR OF PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT. JEREMY MANAGES THE IMPLEMENTATION OF THE FIRM'S ASSET ALLOCATION AND INVESTMENT STRATEGY."}